From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 07:48:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 1: foundation - Hilt, navigation, theming and media
 permission flow

- Add Hilt (with KSP), Navigation Compose, lifecycle-compose and coroutines
- Set up data/domain/presentation-ready package layout (core, di, presentation)
- Bottom navigation shell with Pictures, Albums and Stories placeholders
- Media permission gate (READ_MEDIA_* on 33+, READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE on 31-32)
- MediaPermissionViewModel + PermissionScreen incl. open-settings fallback
- Day/night window theme to avoid white flash on launch
